#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11893
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid ""
"Ktzzzsss.\n"
"You will DIEEee weaklingsss!"
msgstr ""
"...Ktzzzsss...\n"
"Vous allez mourir faibles créatures insignifiantes !"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11897
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid ""
"We wish you no harm, but will harm you if we must.\n"
"End of transmission."
msgstr ""
"Nous ne vous voulons aucun mal, mais nous vous en ferons si nécessaire.\n"
"Fin de transmission."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11901
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Stay out of our way, or your death will amuse us extremely!"
msgstr ""
"Restez en dehors de notre chemin, ou votre mort sera une amusante "
"distraction pour nous !"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11905
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid ""
"One zero one.\n"
"No binary communication detected.\n"
"Switching to universal speech.\n"
"Generating appropriate response for target from human language archives.\n"
":Do not cross us:\n"
"Communication halted."
msgstr ""
"000110011010...Grzzzz...\n"
"Communication binaire non détectée...Grzzz Passons en communication "
"universelle..Grrzzz\n"
"Générons réponse appropriée pour cible en langage humain à partir "
"archives...Grrzzzz\n"
"\n"
"     [Ne nous approchez pas !] Grrzzz\n"
"\n"
"Communication interrompue."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11909
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid ""
"The hive suffers no threats. Opposition to any of us is opposition to us "
"all.\n"
"Stand down or prepare to donate your corpses toward our nutrition."
msgstr ""
"Notre peuple ne tolère aucune menace. S'opposer à l'un d'entre nous c'est "
"s'opposer à nous tous.\n"
"Fuyez ou préparez-vous à faire don de vos cadavres pour nos repas."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11911
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "State your business"
msgstr "Qu'est ce que vous voulez ?"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11914
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "What do you want? (not that we care)"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que vous voulez ? (non pas que ça nous intéresse)"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11916
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Don't waste our time"
msgstr "Ne perdons pas notre temps."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11917
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Mind your own business!"
msgstr "Occupez-vous de vos affaires !"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11927
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "We will destroy you"
msgstr "Nous allons vous détruire"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11930
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "We think not. It is you who will experience destruction!"
msgstr "Nous pensons le contraire. C'est vous qui allez subir la destruction !"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11934
#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:12023
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Your feeble threats are meaningless."
msgstr "Vos menaces ridicules ne nous impressionnent pas."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11938
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "You have no honor"
msgstr "Vous n'avez aucun honneur"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11941
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Your insult has brought our wrath upon you. Prepare to die."
msgstr "Votre insulte a attiré notre colère sur vous. Préparez-vous à mourir !"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11945
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Your comments about honor have no meaning to us"
msgstr "Vos commentaires sur l'honneur n'ont aucune signification pour nous."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11949
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "We pity your pathetic race"
msgstr "Nous plaignons votre race pathétique"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11952
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Pathetic? You will regret your disparagement!"
msgstr ""
"Pathétique ?\n"
"Vous allez regretter votre insolence !"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11956
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "We don't care what you think of us"
msgstr "Peu importe ce que vous pensez de nous."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11962
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "EXECUTE: SELFDESTRUCT"
msgstr "Executer à distance : AUTODESTRUCTION"

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11965
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "Rogue command received. Targeting source."
msgstr ""
"Commande malveillante reçue. Annulée.\n"
"Nous ciblons immédiatement source."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11967
msgctxt "shipEnemy-comms"
msgid "External command ignored."
msgstr "Ordre externe ignoré."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:11970
