#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipEnemy-incCall"
msgid ""
"In accordance to Exuari command directive 2257, we the Exuari Neutralization "
"Division will eradicate %s providing maximum humor and entertainment for all "
"observers. Live short and funny."
msgstr ""
"Conformément à la directive 2257 du commandement Éxuari, nous, la Division "
"de neutralisation Éxuarie (END), allons éradiquer %s en offrant un maximum "
"d'humour et de divertissement à tous les observateurs.\n"
"Vivez court et drôle."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15174
#, lua-format
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid ""
"Satellite stations %s, %s and %s orbiting %s have been reporting periodic "
"problems. See what you can do to help them out"
msgstr ""
"Les stations satellites %s, %s et %s en orbite autour de %s ont signalé des "
"problèmes périodiques. Voyez ce que vous pouvez faire pour les aider."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15182
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Fix satellites orbiting %s"
msgstr "Réparer les satellites en orbite autour de %s."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15192
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid ""
"Planetologist Enrique Flogistan plans to study %s. However, his transport "
"refuses to travel in the area due to increased Exuari activity. Dock with %s "
"and transport the planetologist to %s"
msgstr ""
"Le planétologue Enrique Flogistan prévoit d'étudier %s. Cependant, son "
"vaisseau de transport refuse de circuler dans la région en raison de "
"l'activité accrue des Éxuaris. Amarrez-vous à %s et transportez le "
"planétologue à la station %s."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15199
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Transport planetologist from %s to %s"
msgstr "Transporter le planétologue de la station %s à la station %s."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15210
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Polly-comms"
msgid ""
"Analysis of sightings and readings taken by civilian astronmer Polly Hobbs "
"shows anomalous readings in this area. She lives on station %s according to "
"her published research. Find her, get the source data and investigate. "
"Solicit her assistance if she's willing"
msgstr ""
"L'analyse des observations et les lectures prises par l'astronome civile "
"Polly Hobbs indiquent des lectures anormales dans cette zone.\n"
"Elle vit sur la station %s selon ses recherches publiées. Trouvez-la, "
"récupérez les données sources et enquêtez. Sollicitez son aide si elle le "
"souhaite."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15217
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Dock with %s to investigate astronomer's unusual data"
msgstr ""
"S'amarrer à la station %s pour enquêter sur les données inhabituelles d'un "
"astronome."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15227
msgctxt "marauders-comms"
msgid ""
"Intelligence indicates an imminent attack by the Exuari on a station in the "
"area. Your mission is to protect the station"
msgstr ""
"Les renseignements indiquent une attaque imminente des Éxuaris contre une "
"station de la zone.\n"
"Votre mission est de protéger cette station."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15229
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Defend station from Exuari attack"
msgstr "Défendre la station contre l'attaque des Éxuaris."

#: scripts/scenario_37_unwanted_visitors.lua:15243
